L1: Serum α-Tocopherol and γ-Tocopherol Concentrations and Prostate Cancer Risk in the PLCO Screening Trial: A Nested Case-Control Study
L2: PLoS ONE (2012)
L3: Stephanie J. Weinstein, Ulrike Peters, Jiyoung Ahn, Marlin D. Friesen, Elio Riboli, Richard B. Hayes, Demetrius Albanes
L4: 1 
L5:  Nutritional Epidemiology Branch, Division of Cancer Epidemiology and Genetics, National Cancer Institute, National Institutes of Health, Department of Health and Human Servies, Bethesda, Maryland, United States of America
L6: 2 
L7:  Cancer Prevention Program, Fred Hutchinson Cancer Research Center, Seattle, Washington, United States of America
L8: 3 
L9:  Department of Epidemiology, School of Public Health, University of Washington, Seattle, Washington, United States of America
L10: 4 
L11:  Division of Epidemiology, Department of Population Health, New York University School of Medicine, New York, New York, United States of America
